### UC01 – Request Tour Booking (happy path)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tourId": "tour-alpine-001",
  "tourDate": "2026-06-15",
  "participantCount": 2,
  "contactName": "Klaus Kinsky",
  "contactEmail": "kinsky@example.com"
}

### UC01 – Validation error: past date (400)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tourId": "tour-alpine-001",
  "tourDate": "2020-01-01",
  "participantCount": 2,
  "contactName": "Max Mustermann",
  "contactEmail": "max@example.com"
}

### UC01 – Validation error: participantCount below minimum (400)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tourId": "tour-alpine-001",
  "tourDate": "2026-06-15",
  "participantCount": 0,
  "contactName": "Max Mustermann",
  "contactEmail": "max@example.com"
}

### UC01 – Validation error: missing required fields (400)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tourId": "",
  "tourDate": "2026-06-15",
  "participantCount": 1,
  "contactName": "",
  "contactEmail": ""
}